#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:8
msgid "接入 MCU、IP 与静态实例"
msgstr "Integrate an MCU, IP and static instances"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:10
msgid ""
"先查看[当前支持](../reference/platforms/support.md)，选择实际需要的最小增量。 生产入口为 "
"`soc/<vendor>/<family>/`，硬件算法由 C 实现；主机配置器校验事实并 生成静态连接，不在 SoC／Board 中增加 "
"Python 插件。"
msgstr ""
"First inspect [current support](../reference/platforms/support.md) and "
"choose the smallest increment actually needed. Production entry points live "
"in `soc/<vendor>/<family>/`; C implements hardware algorithms. The host "
"configurator validates facts and generates static connections. Do not add "
"Python plugins within SoC/Board packages."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "增量"
msgstr "Increment"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "修改边界"
msgstr "Change boundary"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "已有 IP 和时钟方案的新料号／封装"
msgstr "New part/package with existing IP and clock profiles"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "精确器件、内存、封装和差异数据"
msgstr "Exact device, memory, package and difference data"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "已有模式的新实例／路线"
msgstr "New instance/route for an existing mode"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "route、资源和 Board 授权；复用 C 驱动"
msgstr "Routes, resources and Board authorization; reuse the C driver"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "新 SoC 复用已知 IP"
msgstr "A new SoC reusing known IP"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "包内启动、时钟、内存、binding 和 CMake 集成"
msgstr "Package-local startup, clock, memory, binding and CMake integration"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "新 IP 沿用已有公开语义"
msgstr "New IP using existing public semantics"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "包内 C、binding 与能力数据"
msgstr "Package-local C, bindings and capability data"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "新公开语义或硬件模型"
msgstr "New public semantics or hardware model"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:0
msgid "先扩展领域合同／policy 和真实测试"
msgstr "First extend the domain contract/policy and real tests"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:22
msgid ""
"同一 MCU 的新 PCB 走[Board 接入](board-porting.md)。新增现有模型的 MCU 不给 公共 resolver "
"添加型号分支；数据也不能替代未知时钟、DMA 或外设算法。"
msgstr ""
"For a new PCB using the same MCU, follow [Board integration](board-"
"porting.md). Adding an MCU within an existing model does not add part-"
"specific branches to the public resolver. Data cannot replace unknown clock,"
" DMA or peripheral algorithms."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:25
msgid "先划分公共语义与硬件模型"
msgstr "First separate public semantics from the hardware model"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:27
msgid ""
"公共 I/O 维护帧、单位、借用、完成和错误语义。IP policy 维护该硬件的时序范围、 FIFO、滤波器和中断原因；SoC "
"提供实际控制器、时钟域与向量，Board 授权路线和电气 条件。新增同模型器件只补事实和 C 绑定；新模型先增加有真实回归的窄 policy。"
msgstr ""
"Public I/O maintains frame, unit, borrow, completion and error semantics."
" An IP policy maintains the hardware's timing ranges, FIFO, filters and "
"interrupt causes. The SoC supplies actual controllers, clock domains and "
"vectors; the Board authorizes routes and electrical conditions. Adding a "
"device with the same model requires only facts and C bindings. A new "
"model first requires a narrow policy with real regressions."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:31
msgid ""
"CAN 控制器显式引用已经解析的 ClockPlan 域，时序检查和生成的 C 配置消费同一 结果。已有 UART／SPI "
"的时钟事实按各自合同维护。公共 CAN 不猜测 APB、core 时钟 或另一控制器的频率。需要同源、同频或主控制器 gate 的 IP "
"分别声明这些约束；相同数值频率不代替同一资源身份。"
msgstr ""
"CAN controllers explicitly reference an already resolved ClockPlan "
"domain; timing checks and generated C configuration consume the same "
"result. Existing UART/SPI clock facts remain governed by their respective"
" contracts. Public CAN does not guess an APB or core clock, or another "
"controller's frequency. An IP block requiring a common source, equal "
"frequencies or the primary controller's gate declares each constraint "
"separately. Equal numerical frequencies do not establish the same "
"resource identity."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:36
msgid ""
"中断原因与物理向量分别声明，不通过列表位置推导 TX、RX 或 error。共享向量只有 在包声明关系、存在已审 C "
"dispatcher，且优先级、OS 调用约束和来源所有权兼容时 接纳。生成器输出一个固定入口，pending、ack 和硬件撤回仍由 C "
"owner 处理。"
msgstr ""
"Declare interrupt causes and physical vectors separately; do not infer "
"TX, RX or error from list positions. A shared vector is admitted only "
"when the package declares the relationship, a reviewed C dispatcher "
"exists, and priorities, OS call constraints and source ownership are "
"compatible. The generator emits one fixed entry; the C owner still "
"handles pending, ack and hardware withdrawal."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:40
msgid ""
"pinmux 使用包选定的编码模型。当前 F4 数值 AF 仅接受 0..15；其他范围由对应模型 和 C driver "
"同时维护，未知编码拒绝。共享 remap 需要真实资源和实现，不能伪装为 较大的 AF 数字。应用继续选择 Board "
"binding，不编写寄存器编码或执行脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Pinmux uses the encoding model selected by the package. The current F4 "
"numerical AF accepts only 0..15. Other ranges must be maintained by both "
"the corresponding model and C driver; reject unknown encodings. Shared "
"remap requires actual resources and implementation and cannot be "
"represented as a larger AF number. Applications continue to select Board "
"bindings; they do not write register encodings or execution scripts."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:44
msgid "按一条纵向路径完成接入"
msgstr "Complete one vertical integration path"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:46
msgid "固定官方手册、数据手册、勘误和 SDK 身份，确认精确料号及可复用 IP。"
msgstr ""
"Pin official manuals, datasheets, errata and SDK identities; establish the "
"exact part and reusable IP."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:47
msgid "在一个包中声明 `package.json`、所需 facts、binding、私有实例布局和 C 行为。"
msgstr ""
"Declare `package.json`, required facts, bindings, private instance layouts "
"and C behavior within one package."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:48
msgid "先以状态 GPIO／console 等最小路径验证 Clock、IRQ、内存与生命周期。"
msgstr ""
"First validate Clock, IRQ, memory and lifecycle through a minimal path such "
"as a status GPIO/console."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:49
msgid "通过同一 TOML 解析和静态生成，实际编译、链接并检查向量及资源。"
msgstr ""
"Resolve and generate statically through the same TOML, then actually "
"compile, link and inspect vectors and resources."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:50
msgid "再按所选模式补请求、取消、迟到 IRQ、排空失败、恢复和实例隔离回归。"
msgstr ""
"For selected modes, add regressions for requests, cancellation, late IRQs, "
"failed drain, recovery and instance isolation."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:51
msgid "对实际导出范围执行源码与安装 SDK 消费，记录精确结果；物理行为另行验收。"
msgstr ""
"Execute source and installed-SDK consumers for the actual export scope and "
"record exact results. Validate physical behavior separately."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:53
msgid ""
"新行为先实际 RED，再最小实现、GREEN 和整理。驱动优先复用审核过的官方 HAL／LL， 厂商类型、Handle "
"和寄存器布局留在实现内部。一个活跃控制器行为域只保留一个 硬件传输 owner，公开接口继续使用 Nexus 类型。"
msgstr ""
"For new behavior, execute actual RED, then the smallest implementation, "
"GREEN and cleanup. Drivers preferentially reuse reviewed official HAL/LL. "
"Vendor types, Handles and register layouts remain private. One active "
"controller behavior domain retains a single hardware-transfer owner; public "
"interfaces continue to use Nexus types."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:57
msgid "构建与生成的责任"
msgstr "Build and generation responsibilities"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:64
msgid ""
"Provider target 发布 `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` 和 `NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`； "
"Platform 用 `NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET` 引用它。每个镜像独立创建 startup OBJECT， "
"私有消费器件宏、配置头和必要 SDK include，不通过公共 `INTERFACE_SOURCES` 把厂商源注入应用。"
msgstr ""
"The provider target publishes `NEXUS_STARTUP_SOURCES` and "
"`NEXUS_STARTUP_USAGE_TARGET`; Platform references it through "
"`NEXUS_PROVIDER_TARGET`. Each image independently creates a startup OBJECT, "
"privately consuming device macros, configuration headers and required SDK "
"includes. Do not inject vendor sources into applications through public "
"`INTERFACE_SOURCES`."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:69
msgid ""
"驱动直接声明 SDK、DMA 和辅助实现需求；System 声明自己的启动环境，不修改兄弟 目录稍后读取的开关。HAL "
"对象复用须证明器件、ABI、配置头与回调相同。"
msgstr ""
"Drivers declare their SDK, DMA and helper implementation requirements "
"directly. System declares its own startup environment without changing "
"switches read later by sibling directories. HAL object reuse must establish "
"identical device, ABI, configuration headers and callbacks."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/guides/provider-porting.md:72
msgid ""
"package 字段、同一输入快照、静态 recipe 与 fragment 语法集中见 "
"[包与绑定合同](../reference/contracts/package-bindings.md)。公开构建入口见 [CMake "
"接入](cmake-consumption.md)，固件行为和失败责任见所属领域合同；不要再维护 另一份 C 源码列表或运行时寄存器脚本。"
msgstr ""
"Package fields, shared input snapshots, static recipes and fragment syntax "
"are centralized in the [package and binding "
"contract](../reference/contracts/package-bindings.md). Public build entry "
"points are in [CMake integration](cmake-consumption.md). Relevant domain "
"contracts own firmware behavior and failure responsibility. Do not maintain "
"another C source list or runtime register script."

msgid ""
"精确器件的物理上限必须贯通到 C 准入和归还。例如 GPIO bank 是否存在由选中的 器件头与 C traits 约束，封装实际引出的 "
"pad 由 facts 约束，PCB 是否允许使用由 Board 约束；不能只提高一个家族共用最大值。退出收条也须接受该器件实际取得的 "
"bank，同时拒绝外来资源。机械事实优先使用既有投影／compiler probe 对照，不增加 运行时器件表或第二份手工能力清单。"
msgstr ""
"Exact device limits must reach C admission and withdrawal. For example, "
"selected device headers and C traits constrain available GPIO banks, "
"facts constrain bonded package pads, and Board data constrains PCB use; "
"do not only increase a family-wide maximum. Withdrawal receipts must "
"accept the banks actually acquired on that device while rejecting "
"foreign resources. Prefer existing projections/compiler probes for "
"mechanical coherence checks, without a runtime device table or a second "
"manually maintained capability list."

msgid ""
"接入后记录这条路径实际修改的文件：器件 facts、Board、binding、C 实现与 SDK／ CMake "
"选择各承担什么差异。已有公共语义的同类器件应复用同一应用 C，新增实例不 增加专用 emitter "
"或中央型号分支。解析器仍统一取得输入快照，先固定 CPU／后端／ 时钟执行条件，再解析设备图，最后冻结唯一 IR "
"并原子发布；不维护另一份可变决定值。 最小装配只生成所选接口和存储，生成源码字节数不能当作最终 Flash／RAM 成本。"
msgstr ""
"After integration, record the files actually changed along this path and"
" the differences owned by device facts, Board, binding, C implementation"
" and SDK/CMake selection. Similar devices with existing public semantics"
" should reuse the same application C; adding an instance must not add a "
"dedicated emitter or central part branch. The resolver still uses one "
"input snapshot, fixes CPU/backend/clock execution conditions before "
"resolving the device graph, then freezes the sole IR and publishes "
"atomically. Do not retain a second mutable decision value. A minimal "
"assembly generates only selected interfaces and storage; generated "
"source bytes are not final Flash/RAM costs."

msgid ""
"`package.json` 选择事实、binding 和构建入口。SoC facts 描述精确器件拥有的资源， "
"`board.json` 授权路线及外部时钟等电气条件，binding 将选择连接到已有 C 实例。 "
"沿用现有 IP 和时钟模型时，先在这三个输入边界表达差异。若所需分频、共享 IRQ 或 "
"DMA 拓扑无法表达，先用一个精确装配和拒绝用例确定新模型边界，再扩展对应的 "
"`tools/configure/domains/` 或 `tools/configure/policies/` 校验与包内 C 行为。"
msgstr ""
"`package.json` selects facts, bindings and the build entry point. SoC facts "
"declare resources the exact device owns, `board.json` authorizes routes and "
"electrical conditions such as external clocks, and bindings connect selections "
"to existing C instances. Express differences in these inputs first for an "
"existing IP and clock model. When the inputs cannot express the required clock "
"division, shared IRQ or DMA topology, use one exact assembly and a rejection "
"case to define the new model before extending the corresponding "
"`tools/configure/domains/` or `tools/configure/policies/` validation and "
"package-local C behavior."

msgid ""
"现有 [F4 "
"同源消费参考](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_family/README.md)使用同一 "
"`gpio_consumer.c` 驱动 `status` 和 `aux`。F407 的软件 Board 授权 PG9／PB2，F479 的 "
"软件 Board 授权 PJ0／PK3。两份 TOML 选择逻辑极性并生成相同的接口类型，F479 的新路线 "
"复用已有 GPIO 实现。按该目录的 ARM 构建命令验证两份装配，同时用越权 pad 或路线验证 "
"解析拒绝。物理 PCB 接线另需测量证据。"
msgstr ""
"The maintained [same-source F4 consumer "
"reference](https://github.com/X-Gen-Lab/nexus/blob/NEXUS-DOCUMENTATION-SOURCE/tests/contracts/stm32f4_family/README.md)"
" drives `status` and `aux` from the same `gpio_consumer.c`. The F407 "
"software Board authorizes PG9/PB2, and the F479 software Board authorizes "
"PJ0/PK3. The two TOML files select logical polarity and generate the same "
"interface type. The new F479 routes reuse the existing GPIO implementation. "
"Use that directory's ARM build commands to verify both assemblies and check "
"that the resolver rejects an unauthorized pad or route. Physical PCB wiring "
"requires separate measurement evidence."
